Subject: [PATCH 12/12] Track .personal-build/ so the tooling and docs travel
 with the branch

Previously deliberately untracked (kept off main by never committing it),
but that also meant it wasn't archived/portable with the rest of this
branch's work. Adds SETUP.md: recovery instructions plus every non-obvious
gotcha discovered while building this (MOZILLABUILD path, the
build-binaries-stale-header trap, NS_WARNING being a no-op outside DEBUG
builds, content-process stderr not being visible via -attach-console,
mach build installer not being a real target, etc.) so this is recoverable
from scratch without re-learning all of it the hard way.
